
Applies on top of john-bradshaw/rxn-lm@76ffe65 (main).

Includes:
- Bidirectional (mixed forward/backward) reaction prediction:
  new <fwd>/<rev> prefix tokens in the tokenizer, mixed-direction
  training and evaluation support, updated vocab file.
- Second vocab file for single-direction runs (vocab_uspto_mixed_augm_one_dir.json).
- Training augmentation (SMILES randomization) support.
- Order-agnostic evaluation.
- Serving code (scripts/serving/serve.py, rxn_lm/server_utils/) exposing
  a FastAPI predict endpoint.
- Updated data-prep vocab script for the new prefix tokens.
- New training configs under scripts/training/configs/uspto_augm/.
